  "description": "Enterprise-ready modular file management framework for .NET 8.0/9.0. Provides intelligent file processing, multi-provider storage (Azure Blob, AWS S3), CDN integration, AI-powered content analysis, and comprehensive metadata management. Built with Clean Architecture and SOLID principles. Pay-as-you-use modular design - enable only the features you need. Perfect for modern applications requiring robust file handling capabilities.",
