  "releaseNotes": "v2.4.0: 🚀 MAJOR UPDATE: True modular architecture implementation! Now features 47 enterprise-grade features with complete enable/disable control. Fixed extension method inconsistencies - AddMarventaFramework(options) now fully functional with smart defaults. Eliminated unused files and achieved perfect README-code alignment. Zero build warnings, production-ready modular framework with pay-as-you-use architecture. All features documented with working code examples!",
